---
import { REAL_ESTATE_THRESHOLD_NOTE } from '../data/program';
---

<section class="section section--text" id="program">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head scroll-reveal" id="investment">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-navy">The program</p>
      <h2>Three routes to Panamanian residency.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Real estate is the lowest cash outlay under Decree 17. {REAL_ESTATE_THRESHOLD_NOTE} A qualifying investment under Executive Decree 17 of 2026 covers titled real estate, listed securities, or a fixed-term bank deposit. Route-by-route requirements and ownership rules are on the visa page. Government fees sit on top of the investment; see the <a class="inline-link" href="/panama-qualified-investor-visa-cost">full cost breakdown</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="section-more">
      <a class="cta-link cta-link--cream" href="/panama-qualified-investor-visa-2026#investment-routes">
        Compare the three routes
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    background: #405363;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1rem);
  }

  .sec-head {
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1rem);
  }

  .sec-head h2 {
    color: var(--color-on-navy);
  }

  .lede {
    color: var(--color-on-navy-dim);
    margin: var(--space-lede) 0 0;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
</style>
